{
  "about": "Month keepsakes: when a month is delivered, its stamps are looked at and the month gets a name and one of your sticker packs to feature. A month needs at least minStamps stamps. The most common topic wins if it shows up minTopicCount or more times (see topics.json for the ids); otherwise the most common feeling (feelings.json). Each entry is { name, pack } where pack is a sticker pack id from sticker-packs.json (cozy, cafe, autumn, sweet, memories, post, cherry, pink, matcha, blue, sunshine, vintage, chrome, journal). Anything not listed uses fallback. Change a name or point a topic at another pack freely; the tests only check that every pack id exists.",
